self.KB_CONTENT["card:756035"]={"id":"card:756035","ty":"card","sourceId":"756035","title":"『銷貨單明細表』中的『選擇確認狀態 (COP.TG023)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","銷貨單","狀態"],"y":"other","answer":"* 指要選擇的銷貨單核准狀態。* 計Y.已確認(『核」)、N.未確認(『 」)、V.作廢(『廢」)及全部四種。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:753403"]={"id":"card:753403","ty":"card","sourceId":"753403","title":"『程式註記/簽核建立作業』中的『每頁列印註記 (MT009)』為何？","ver":"iGP","topic":"簽核","keywords":["簽核","註記"],"y":"other","answer":"* 可勾選是否於列印時，每頁列印註記資料。* 預設N。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
